resolution: "Rechecked main 874ef8f: the committed pm-rl snapshot includes hooks, and catalog tests derive and compare package capabilities from that snapshot. Evidence: src/services/package-catalog.ts, test/catalog.test.ts and test/fleet-extensions.snapshot.json. Historical PR 175 and 196 delivery receipts remain retained."
