    text: "PR #196 synchronization complete against main 06958bd. npm release first attempt: 580 tests, 578 pass/1 fail/1 cancelled; one unchanged retry green 580/580, 0 fail/cancel/skip/todo. Bun first attempt fully green 580/580, 0 fail/cancel/skip/todo. Each full green gate includes production audit 0, packed consumers 4/4 and all release metadata checks. npm coverage S/L 90.60, B 80.61, F 93.45; Bun S/L 90.58, B 80.55, F 93.45; all 34 configured source files. The original Presets aggregate 300-second deadline failure is load-sensitive: retry built/source 263.036/256.095 seconds, Bun 218.519/121.904; source ENOTDIR did not recur after normal completion. Repeated CLI ownership/state/execution startups consume the budget; no deterministic defect reproduced. Timing risk remains open. Prior behavioural revert proofs retained, no new implementation changes. Details and exact commands in docs/SDK_2026_10_14.md. Claims released for verification; no items closed."
